# This repo is developed on Linux/macOS (Docker containers, shell scripts
# with shebangs) but may be cloned on Windows too. Without this, Windows
# Git defaults (core.autocrlf) -- or, as found while setting up a Windows
# contributor, something in the local sync/OS layer independent of git --
# can silently convert every text file to CRLF on checkout, which breaks
# any shell script executed inside a Linux container (bad interpreter) and
# makes every file show as fully modified in git status/diff for no real
# reason. Force LF for everything git itself controls, regardless of OS.
* text=auto eol=lf
